 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
----

Duisburg is involved in many kinds of sports. Nevertheless, most important for its inhabitants is the local soccer club [[MSV Duisburg]]. Other popular sports are Icehockey, Baseball, American Football, Water polo, Baseball and Hockey. 
Recently, with the new MSV Arena the city received a brandnew sports stadium for various kinds of sports such as soccer and football.
During the summer months of 2005 the [[World Games]] took place in Duisburg.

Duisburg is also known for its rowing- and canoeing regattas and the world championships that take place here regularly.

== Buildings and Constructions ==
