      <comment>dab</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Salhouse Broad''' is situated on the [[River Bure]] within [[The Broads National Park]] in [[Norfolk, England]]. 

The broad is situated just off the river and doesn't attract through traffic. It is to the south of [[Hoveton Great Broad]] and about half a mile to the north of the village of [[Salhouse]]. The broad is entirely rural and offers no facilities except for mooring.

[[Category:Norfolk Broads]]
