[[Image:Universiteit_Twente_Het_Ding_20050628.jpg|thumb|220px|art on the campus]]
'''Universiteit Twente''' is a [[university]] located in [[Enschede]], [[Netherlands]]. It was founded in [[1961]], and is unique in that it is the only &quot;campus&quot; type university in the country. The emphasis is mainly on technical subjects combined with sociocultural aspects. 

==Education==

&lt;h5&gt;Faculties&lt;h5&gt;

*School of Business, Public Administration and Technology (BBT)
*Faculty of Electrical Engineering, Mathematics and Computer Science (EEMCS)
*Faculty of Engineering Technology (CTW)
*Faculty of Behavioural Sciences (GW)
*Faculty of Science and Technology (TNW)

&lt;h5&gt;Undergraduate Studies&lt;h5&gt;

*Advanced Technology
*Applied Mathematics
*Applied Physics
*Business Information Technology
*Biomedical Technology
*Business Administration
*Chemical Engineering
*Civil Engineering and Management
*Communication Studies
*Computer Science
*Educational Design, Management &amp; Media
*Electrical Engineering
*Health Sciences
*Industrial Design Engineering
*Mechanical Engineering
*Public Administration
*Psychology
*Philosophy of Science, Technology and Society
