'''Watarrka''' is a national park in the [[Northern Territory]] ([[Australia]]), 1316 km south of [[Darwin, Northern Territory|Darwin]] and 323 km southwest of Alice Springs. It contains the much visited [[Kings Canyon, Northern Territory|Kings Canyon]] at the western end of the George Gill Range and Kathleen Springs (22 km to the southeast of Kings Canyon).

