      <minor />
      <comment>Guanaco - Robot bypassing redirects: United_States_of_America</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Westford''' is the name of several places in the [[United States|United States of America]]:
*[[Westford, Connecticut]]
*[[Westford, Massachusetts]]
*[[Westford, New York]]
*[[Westford, Pennsylvania]]
*[[Westford, Vermont]]
*[[Westford, Wisconsin]]
  
