      <minor />
      <comment>removed extraneous space and periods</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Margate''' can refer to the following locations:

*[[Margate, Kent]] - a seaside resort on the northern coast of the county of [[Kent]], in the [[United Kingdom]]
*[[Margate, Florida]] - a town in [[Florida]], in the [[United States]]
*[[Margate, Maryland]] - a town in [[Maryland]], in the [[United States]]
*[[Margate City, New Jersey]] - a city in [[New Jersey]], in the [[United States]]
*[[Margate, Tasmania]] - a small town in [[Tasmania]], in [[Australia]].
*[[Margate, South Africa]] - a seaside resort on the south coast of [[KwaZulu-Natal]], in [[South Africa]]
*[[Margate, Queensland]] - a little village on the [[Redcliffe, Queensland|Redcliffe peninsula]]

