      <text xml:space="preserve">The &quot;Land of the Rising Sun&quot; is one of the [[names of Japan]].

'''Rising Sun''' may also be:
* [[Rising Sun (book)]], a novel involving Japan by Michael Crichton
* [[Rising Sun (movie)]], a movie based on Crichton's novel starring Sean Connery and Wesley Snipes
* [[Rising Sun (yacht)]], a yacht owned by Oracle billionaire Larry Ellison

'''Places in the United States''':
* [[Rising Sun, Indiana]]
* [[Rising Sun, Maryland]]
* [[Risingsun, Ohio]]

'''Rising sun''' may also refer to:
* [[New Rising Sun]], a rock band from Montgomery, Alabama, USA
* [[The House of the Rising Sun]], a folk song about a brothel in New Orleans made famous in a cover by The Animals, a British rock and roll band

