== Fair use for ''[[Starship Troopers]]'' ==
This image, Starship Troopers.jpg, is being linked here; though the picture is subject to copyright I ([[User:Palm dogg|Palm_Dogg]]) feel it is covered by the U.S. fair use laws because:

#It does not limit the copyright owner's rights to sell the book in any way;
# Its inclusion adds significantly to the article, by illustrating how different individuals have visualized ''Starship Troopers''.
# ''Starship Troopers'' has been released for public purposes.  Therefore, this cover is intended for wide distribution.
# The image is being used in an informative way and should not detract from the book.

