*[http://www.hindu.com/thehindu/nic/narayanankr.pdf Interview] on Independence day; [[15 August]] [[1998]]; by [[N. Ram]], Editor, [[Frontline (magazine)|Frontline]] [`K. R. Narayanan in conversation with N. Ram', ''The Hindu'', 10 Nov. 2005. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006]. 
**Commentary: Praveen Swami: [http://www.frontlineonnet.com/fl1518/15181320.htm `A citizen and a President'], ''Frontline'' '''15''' (18), 29 Aug. - 11 Sep. 1998. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
