*[http://web.archive.org/web/20010220235512/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr119.htm Rashtrapati Bhavan communique concerning the dissolution of the twelfth Lok Sabha]; [[26 April]] [[1999]]. Archived Feb. 2001.
**Related communiques: [http://web.archive.org/web/20010220235112/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr112.htm 14 April]; [http://web.archive.org/web/20010220235554/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr113.htm 17 April]; [http://web.archive.org/web/20010220235535/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr114.htm 20 April]; [http://web.archive.org/web/20010220235229/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr116.htm 22 April]; [http://web.archive.org/web/20010425070155/alfa.nic.in/rb/pr118.htm 23 April]. Archived Feb. 2001.
*[http://www.indiatogether.org/opinions/speeches/krn2000.htm Address on the golden jubilee of the Indian Republic]; [[26 January]] [[2000]]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
**Commentary: [[P. Sainath]]: [http://www.frontlineonnet.com/fl1703/17030290.htm `Iron in the soul, decay in the brain'], ''Frontline'' '''17''' (3), 5 - 18 Feb. 2000. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
**Commentary: V. Venkatesan: [http://www.frontlineonnet.com/fl1703/17030280.htm `A wake-up call'], ''Frontline'' '''17''' (3), 5 - 18 Feb. 2000. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
*[http://www.india-seminar.com/2000/487/487%20narayanan.htm Address in Parliament, and in the Supreme court, on the golden jubilee of the Republic]; [[26 January]] [[2000]]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
*[http://meaindia.nic.in/speech/2001/01/25spc01.htm Address on Republic day]; [[26 January]] [[2001]]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
**Commentary: Sukumar Muralidharan: [http://www.flonnet.com/fl1803/18031200.htm `A presidential intervention'], ''Frontline'' '''18''' (3), 3-16 Feb. 2001. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
*[http://meaindia.nic.in/event/2002/01/25event01.htm Address on Republic day]; [[26 January]] [[2002]]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
**[http://www.ambedkar.org/News/TheBhopalDeclaration.htm Bhopal declaration]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
**Commentary: V. Venkatesan: [http://www.frontlineonnet.com/fl1903/19031240.htm `A presidential message'], ''Frontline'' '''19''' (3), 2-15 Feb. 2001. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.
