*Interview of February 2005 in which K. R. Narayanan accused the A. B. Vajpayee Government of complicity in the [[2002 Gujarat riots]]; by [[P. T. Thomas]], Congress legislator from [[Thodupuzha]] in the [[Kerala Legislative Assembly]], and Editor, ''Maanavasamskruthi''. [`Interview with K. R. Narayanan', ''Maanavasamskruthi'' '''1''' (8), February 2005, in [[Malayalam]]. English translation at CHRO web page: [http://www.nuke.humanrightskerala.com/modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=5090 Part I]; [http://www.nuke.humanrightskerala.com/modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=5097 Part II]. Retrieved 24 Feb. 2006.]

