      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Narawntapu''' (formerly known as &quot;Asbestos Range&quot;) is a national park in [[Tasmania]] ([[Australia]]), 205 km north of [[Hobart, Australia|Hobart]]. It has been referred to as &quot;[[Tasmania]]'s [[Serengeti]]&quot;, owing to the abundance of wildlife in the Springlawn area of the park.

==Fact sheet==
*''Area:'' 4,349 ha
*''[[geographic coordinates|Coordinates]]'': {{coor dms|41|07|58|S|146|39|24|E|type:landmark_region:AU}}
*''Date of establishment:'' 1976
*''Managing authorities:'' Tasmania Parks and Wildlife Service
*''[[World Conservation Union|IUCN]] category:'' II

==See also==
* [[Protected areas of Tasmania (Australia)]]

[[Category:National parks of Tasmania]]
