      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox Film |
  name        = The Family Man |
  image       = The Family Man film.jpg |
  writer      = [[David Diamond]],&lt;br&gt;[[David Weissman]] |
  starring    = [[Nicholas Cage]],&lt;br&gt;[[Téa Leoni]],&lt;br&gt;[[Don Cheadle]] |
