*[[Finglandrigg Woods NNR]], [[Cumbria]] '''S'''
*[[Gait Barrows NNR]], [[Lancashire]] '''S'''
*[[Gibraltar Point|Gibraltar Point NNR]], [[Lincolnshire]] '''S'''
*[[Golitha Falls NNR]], [[Cornwall]] '''S'''
*[[Gordano valley]], [[Avon (county)|Avon]]
*[[Goss Moor NNR]] [[Cornwall]]
