For a full list of NNRs in England see
:[http://www.english-nature.org.uk/special/nnr/nnr_results.asp?nnr_name=&amp;Search=1&amp;c=0&amp;habitat=0&amp;natural_area=&amp;local_team=0&amp;Submit1=Search English Nature's NNR page]

