'''''1,000 Hours''''' is [[Green Day]]'s first [[Extended play|EP]], which was recorded in [[1988]] and released on [[Lookout! Records]].  It was the band's first of several releases for the independent record label that nurtured the band's development in their early years. 

In [[1991]], all of the songs from ''1,000 Hours'' were reissued on ''[[1,039/Smoothed Out Slappy Hours]]''.

==Track listing==

