* '''[[Golden Globe Award for Best Actor - Motion Picture Drama|Best Motion Picture Actor-Drama]]''' - [[Peter Finch]]&lt;br&gt;
* '''[[Golden Globe Award for Best Actress - Motion Picture Drama|Best Motion Picture Actress-Drama]]''' - [[Faye Dunaway]]&lt;br&gt;
* '''[[Golden Globe Award for Best Director - Motion Picture|Best Director]]''' - [[Sidney Lumet]]&lt;br&gt;
